{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "qassure-api-collection",
    "name": "QAssure Platform API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for QAssure Platform Backend.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Set the `base_url` variable to your server URL\n2. Run the \"Login (Super Admin)\" request first\n3. The access token will be automatically saved\n4. Other requests will use the saved token\n\n## Test Credentials\n\n- **Super Admin**: superadmin@qassure.ai / Password123!\n- **Tenant Admin**: admin@qassure.ai / Password123!\n- **Viewer**: viewer@qassure.ai / Password123!",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tenant_id",
      "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "module_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "verification_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "reset_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
